.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KLDLOAD-AI-WEBUI 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kldload-ai-webui
.Nd set up Open WebUI in front of the local Ollama, from the image when it can
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Open WebUI is kldload's chat interface to the local models.
.Nm ,
run by first boot and the automatic deployment, in order:
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
points the name
.Ql ollama ,
which the desktop tile opens, at this machine;
.It
places the Whisper weights so voice input works offline;
.It
loads the Open WebUI container image from the image's darksite, or pulls
it when the image carries none;
.It
creates the container, connected to the local Ollama, with its document
search using a model already on disk;
.It
has it start again after a reboot;
.It
waits for port 8080 to answer.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print the header comment and exit 0.
.El
